---
import ContentPage from "@/layouts/ContentPage.astro";
---
<ContentPage
  title="Contact SpedCentral"
  description="Get in touch with SpedCentral -- for families, providers, product creators, or press and partnership inquiries."
  heading="Contact Us"
>
  <p>
    The fastest way to reach us is email -- we route by topic so your message gets to the right person. We
    typically respond within 1-2 business days.
  </p>

  <h2>Families</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about a listing, need help finding the right specialist, or want to report an issue with a provider
    or review? Email <a href="mailto:families@spedcentral.com">families@spedcentral.com</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Providers &amp; specialists</h2>
  <p>
    Want to list your practice, update an existing listing, or ask about featured placement? Email
    <a href="mailto:providers@spedcentral.com">providers@spedcentral.com</a> or visit
    <a href="/list-your-practice/">List Your Practice</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Product creators &amp; brands</h2>
  <p>
    Selling a physical product, printable, or digital resource for SPED families and teachers? Email
    <a href="mailto:products@spedcentral.com">products@spedcentral.com</a> or visit
    <a href="/sell-your-products/">Sell Your Products</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Press, partnerships &amp; everything else</h2>
  <p>
    For anything that doesn't fit above -- including privacy or accessibility questions -- email
    <a href="mailto:hello@spedcentral.com">hello@spedcentral.com</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Mailing address</h2>
  <p>SpedCentral, Inc.<br />Houston, TX</p>
</ContentPage>
